# MediSense overlay for RuView's esp32-csi-node firmware. Applied last, on top
# of RuView's sdkconfig.defaults and its devkitc (8 MB) or 4mb overlay.

# Plain dev boards (ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 and friends) have no AMOLED panel. With
# display support compiled in, RuView's panel probe can false-positive on them,
# which skips the MGMT+DATA CSI upgrade and drops CSI to 0 frames/s
# (see RuView's sdkconfig.defaults.devkitc). Compile it out.
# CONFIG_DISPLAY_ENABLE is not set

# RuView drives the onboard RGB LED as a 40 Hz flickering light by default.
# Nobody wants that next to them while meditating: keep the LED off.
# CONFIG_LED_GAMMA_VIZ is not set

# Hot-loadable WASM sensing modules (tier 3) are not used by MediSense. This
# matches RuView's own S3 qualification build, where tier 3 was absent.
# CONFIG_WASM_ENABLE is not set
